23:26.272 --> 23:28.282
The Next Episode Preview Corner
Huh? I'm out of focus!

23:28.282 --> 23:30.192
The Next Episode Preview Corner
That's why I said it came out nicely.

23:30.192 --> 23:30.862
The Next Episode Preview Corner
See?

23:30.862 --> 23:32.222
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:32.222 --> 23:32.242
At the End of Summer
The Next Episode Preview Corner

